{
  "pid": "self-hard-05",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "title": "燃烧状态与氧量修正联锁（熄火跳闸 + 分析仪故障降级）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，实现燃烧器的火焰联锁与烟气氧量修正。\n控制要求：\n1. 运行请求 runRequest 为 TRUE 且火焰探测器 flameOK 为 FALSE 时，**当拍**置位熄火跳闸 tripLatched，并切断燃料许可；\n2. tripLatched 自保持，只有在 runRequest=FALSE 且 flameOK=FALSE（停机且无火焰的安全态）的前提下，resetBtn 的**上升沿**才能清除。复位是边沿命令而不是保持命令：按住的时长不影响判定，每拍只认有没有新的上升沿；复位那一刻条件不满足就无效，之后条件满足了但还按着（没有新上升沿）也**不得**清除；runRequest 仍为 TRUE 或 flameOK 仍为 TRUE 时按下的复位同样无效；\n3. fuelPermit = runRequest AND flameOK AND NOT tripLatched；\n4. 氧量修正：trimEnable = fuelPermit AND NOT o2Fault；airTrim = 2.0 * (2.0 - o2PV)，并钳位到 [-10, +10]；trimEnable=FALSE 时 airTrim 必须为 0.0。说明：±10 是**输出约束**，不代表两个方向都能到饱和——合法量程 0..21% 内原始修正只在 [-38, +4] 之间（o2PV=0 得 +4，o2PV=21 得 -38），因此正向限幅在本题永远不触发，只有 o2PV > 7.0 时负向限幅才起作用；增益偏小属于演示取舍，真实装置的风门增益取决于风道流通能力；\n5. o2Fault = NOT o2Valid OR o2PV < 0.0 OR o2PV > 21.0（分析仪故障只切除修正，**不得**切除燃料；o2Valid=TRUE 但 o2PV<0 同样判故障）；\n6. airCommand = baseAir + airTrim，钳位到 [0, 100]；fuelPermit=FALSE 时 airCommand 必须为 0.0。说明：baseAir 是外部基础开度给定，本题**不要求** baseAir 自身落在 0..100，只要求最终 airCommand 落在 0..100（baseAir+airTrim 可能为负，此时钳位到 0）；\n7. 范围声明：本题只考核**运行阶段**的火焰联锁与氧量修正。预吹扫、点火、火焰建立等启动顺序，以及完整燃烧器安全管理（BMS，含吹扫时的风门要求）不在本题范围内，由其他系统负责。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "runRequest",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "燃烧运行请求",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "flameOK",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "火焰探测器反馈（TRUE=检测到火焰）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "o2Valid",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "氧量分析仪数据有效",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "o2PV",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "烟气含氧量测量值（%）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "baseAir",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "主风门基础开度给定（%），外部给定，自身不要求在 0..100",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resetBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "复位按钮（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fuelPermit",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "燃料允许（联锁输出）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "trimEnable",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "氧量修正投入（无故障才为 TRUE）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "airTrim",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "氧量修正偏置（%），钳位 ±10",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "airCommand",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "风门开度命令（%），钳位 0..100",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "tripLatched",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "熄火跳闸自保持",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "o2Fault",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "氧量分析仪故障（无效或越界）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "运行中失去火焰时，**同一周期**就必须跳闸（不得延迟一拍）。",
      "ltl": "G((runRequest & !flameOK) -> tripLatched)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "跳闸一旦置位就自保持；只有\"runRequest=FALSE 且 flameOK=FALSE 下的复位上升沿\"这一个条件能清除它，其余任何一拍（含按住不复位、条件不满足时按复位）都必须保持。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(tripLatched) & !(rising(resetBtn) & !runRequest & !flameOK)) -> tripLatched)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "跳闸状态下绝不允许燃料许可。",
      "ltl": "G(tripLatched -> !fuelPermit)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "燃料许可的完整定义：运行请求、火焰正常、未跳闸三者同时成立才允许，缺一不可。",
      "ltl": "G(fuelPermit <-> (runRequest & flameOK & !tripLatched))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "无燃料许可时风门命令必须归零（防止停机后残留开度）。",
      "ltl": "G(!fuelPermit -> airCommand = 0.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "风门命令恒在 0..100 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((airCommand >= 0.0) & (airCommand <= 100.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "氧量修正偏置恒在 ±10 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((airTrim >= -10.0) & (airTrim <= 10.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S8",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "修正投入的完整定义：有燃料许可且分析仪无故障才投入；故障当拍即整段切除。",
      "ltl": "G(trimEnable <-> (fuelPermit & !o2Fault))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S9",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "故障判据：数据无效、低于 0 或高于 21 三者任一成立。",
      "ltl": "G(o2Fault <-> (!o2Valid | o2PV < 0.0 | o2PV > 21.0))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S10",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "修正切除时偏置必须归 0（不得残留上一次的修正量）。",
      "ltl": "G(!trimEnable -> airTrim = 0.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S11",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "只有 o2PV > 7.0 一侧能触到负向限幅：此时偏置被钳在 -10。",
      "ltl": "G((trimEnable & o2PV > 7.0) -> airTrim = -10.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S12",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "o2PV <= 7.0 一侧未达限幅：偏置严格等于 2.0*(2.0-o2PV)。",
      "ltl": "G((trimEnable & o2PV <= 7.0) -> airTrim = 2.0 * (2.0 - o2PV))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S13",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "修正后合成开度超上限时命令钳在 100，且不改变偏置本身。",
      "ltl": "G((fuelPermit & baseAir + airTrim > 100.0) -> airCommand = 100.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S14",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "修正后合成开度为负时命令钳在 0（baseAir 可以小于 10）。",
      "ltl": "G((fuelPermit & baseAir + airTrim < 0.0) -> airCommand = 0.0)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S15",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "系数与钳位后的合成值：由仿真用例逐拍核对（净收益/风门数值语义）。",
      "ltl": "",
      "verified_by": "simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S16",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "熄火运行才触发新跳闸；已有跳闸在合法安全复位沿当拍清除。",
      "ltl": "G(tripLatched <-> ((runRequest AND !flameOK) OR (prev(tripLatched) AND !(rising(resetBtn) AND !runRequest AND !flameOK))))",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S17",
      "kind": "safety",
      "text": "有燃料许可且基础量与修正量之和落在闭区间内，输出必须等于两者之和。",
      "ltl": "G((fuelPermit AND baseAir + airTrim >= 0.0 AND baseAir + airTrim <= 100.0) -> airCommand = baseAir + airTrim)",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    }
  ],
  "test_cases": [
